ttributes":{},"children":["bloc"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>bitmap location data</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["ビットマップの位置データ"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>Provides pointers to the appropriate bitmap data for each bitmap glyph\n      in Apple fonts. 'EBLC' is used by MS/Adobe instead (and has the same format)</TD> "},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["Apple のフォントにおいては、各ビットマップグリフに該当するビットマップデータへのポインタを提供します。MS/Adobe では、この代わりに‘EBLC’を使用します (フォーマットはこれと同じです)"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6bloc.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6bloc.html"},"children":["bloc"]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n      *"]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["CFF"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD><A HREF=\"http://partners.adobe.com/asn/developer/pdfs/tn/5176.CFF.pdf\">Compact\n      Font Format</A></TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://partners.adobe.com/asn/developer/pdfs/tn/5176.CFF.pdf"},"children":["コンパクトフォントフォーマット"]}]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>Provides all the outline data (and sometimes glyph names as well) for\n      the PostScript\n      <A HREF=\"http://partners.adobe.com/asn/developer/pdfs/tn/5177.Type2.pdf\">Type2</A>\n      font that is the heart of an OpenType font. Vaguely equivalent to 'glyf'\n      , 'loca' and 'post' combined.</TD> "},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["OpenType フォントの中核となる PostScript ",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://partners.adobe.com/asn/developer/pdfs/tn/5177.Type2.pdf"},"children":["Type2"]}," フォントのすべてのアウトラインデータ (それに加えてグリフ名も) を提供します。大雑把に言えば、‘glyf’,‘loca’および‘post’を組み合わせた物と同等と言えます。"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n      *"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_cff.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_cff.html"},"children":["CFF"]}]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["cmap"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>character code mapping</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["文字コードとの対応"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>Provides at least one encoding from a stream of bytes to glyphs in the\n      font. FontForge provides at least three encodings in every font (one for\n      Mac Roman, one for Mac Unicode, one for MS Unicode). For some fonts it will\n      additionally provide a CJK encoding (Big5, SJIS, etc) or an extended unicode\n      encoding which will cover code points outside of the BMP. "},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["バイトのストリームからフォント内のグリフへの対応づけを行うエンコーディングを少なくとも 1 個は提供します。FontForge は、各フォントに対して最低 3 個のエンコーディング (1 個は Mac Roman, 1 個は Mac Unicode, もう 1 個は MS Unicode です) を提供します。いくつかのフォントでは、CJK エンコーディング (Big5, SJIS など) または BMP に収まらないコードポイントをカバーする拡張 Unicode エンコーディングも提供します。\n      ",{"tag":"p","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"comment":"  For fonts with special 1-byte encodings (such as symbol) it will provide\n      a \"symbol\" encoding which maps a known page in the corporate use area to\n      the glyphs.</TD> "},"\n      特殊な1バイトエンコーディング (Symbol など) をもつフォントに対しては、社用領域の基地の領域を各グリフに割り当てる“Symbol”エンコーディングを提供します。"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6cmap.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6cmap.html"},"children":["cmap"]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_cmap.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_cmap.html"},"children":["cmap"]}]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["cvar"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>variations on cvt table</TD> "},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["cvt テーブルに対するバリエーション"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>Used to specify hinting differences in distortable fonts</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["変形可能フォントにおけるヒントの差分情報を提供します。"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6cvar.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6cvar.html"},"children":["cvar"]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n      *"]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["cvt"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>control value table</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["制御値テーブル (control value table)\n",{"comment":"<TD>FontForge uses this when it attempts to hint truetype fonts (FontForge\n      will read it from a font and save it into another).</TD> "},"\n"]},{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["FontForge は、TrueType フォントにヒントづけを行おうとするときにこれを使用します (フォントからこれを読み込み、保存時に再び書き出します)。\n    "]},{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6cvt.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6cvt.html"},"children":["cvt"]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_cvt.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_cvt.html"},"children":["cvt"]}]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["EBDT"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>embedded bitmap data</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["埋め込みビットマップデータ"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>Provides the actual bitmap data for all bitmap glyphs in MS/Adobe fonts.\n      'bdat' is used by Apple instead (and has the same format)</TD> "},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["MS/Adobe のフォントですべてのビットマップグリフの実際のビットマップデータを提供します。Apple では代わりに‘bdat’が用いられます (フォーマットは同じです)"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n      *"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_ebdt.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_ebdt.html"},"children":["EBDT"]}]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["EBLC"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>embedded bitmap location</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["埋め込みビットマップ位置"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>Provides pointers to the appropriate bitmap data for each bitmap glyph\n      in MS/Adobe fonts. 'bloc' is used by Apple instead (and has the same format)</TD> "},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["MS/Adobe のフォントで、各ビットマップグリフに該当するビットマップへのポインタを提供します。Apple では代わりに‘bloc’が用いられます (フォーマットは同じです)"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n      *"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_eblc.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_eblc.html"},"children":["EBLC"]}]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["EBSC"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>embedded bitmap scaling</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["埋め込みビットマップのスケーリング"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>Provides information on how to scale bitmaps (on those rare occasions\n      where this is desirable). FontForge uses it when making bitmap only fonts\n      for windows.</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["ビットマップのスケーリングをどのように行うかに関する情報 (それを行うのが望ましい稀な場合) を提供します。FontForge は、Windows 用のビットマップのみのフォントを作成する時にこれを使用します。"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6EBSC.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6EBSC.html"},"children":["EBSC"]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_ebsc.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_ebsc.html"},"children":["EBSC"]}]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["feat"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>layout feature table</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["レイアウト機能テーブル"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>Maps features specified in Apple's 'morx' (or 'mort') tables into names\n      provided in the 'name' table. FontForge generates this when it generates\n      a 'morx' table.</TD> "},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["Apple の‘morx’(または‘mort’) テーブルから、‘name’テーブルが提供している名前への対応づけを行います。FontForge は‘morx’テーブルを生成するときにはこれも生成します。\n    "]},{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6feat.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6feat.html"},"children":["feat"]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n      *"]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["fpgm"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>font program</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["フォントプログラム"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>FontForge never generates this, but it will preserve it and allows users\n      to edit it.</TD> "},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["FontForge はこれを決して生成しませんが、これを保持してユーザが編集できるようにします。\n    "]},{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6fpgm.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6fpgm.html"},"children":["fpgm"]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_fpgm.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_fpgm.html"},"children":["fpgm"]}]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["fvar"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>font variations</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["フォントバリエーション"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>Provides top level information about distortable fonts. Specifies the\n      types of distortions possible.</TD> "},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["変形可能フォントに関するトップレベルの情報を提供します。可能な変形のタイプを指定します。"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6fvar.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6fvar.html"},"children":["fvar"]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n      *"]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["gasp"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>grid-fitting and scan conversion</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["グリッド合わせおよびスキャン変換"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>When FontForge does not attempt to hint a truetype font it will generate\n      this table which tells the rasterizer not to to do grid-fitting (hinting)\n      but to do anti-aliasing instead.</TD> "},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["FontForge が TrueType フォントのヒントづけを試みない場合、ラスタライザにグリッド合わせ (ヒント処理) を行わずに、アンチエイリアスを行うように指定します。"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6gasp.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6gasp.html"},"children":["gasp"]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_gasp.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_gasp.html"},"children":["gasp"]}]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["GDEF"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>glyph definition</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["グリフ定義"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>Divides glyphs into various classes that make using the GPOS/GSUB tables\n      easier. Also provides internal caret positions for ligatures. It is approximately\n      equivalent to Apple's 'prop' and 'lcar' tables