car.html"},"children":["lcar"]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n      *"]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["loca"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>glyph location</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["グリフ位置"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>This provides a pointer into the 'glyf' table for each glyph in the font.\n      It is required for truetype and meaningless for opentype (where vaguely\n      equivalent information is provided in the CFF table).</TD> "},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["このテーブルは、フォントファイルが含む各グリフの‘glyf’テーブル内へのポインタを提供します。TrueType では必須であり、OpenType では無意味です (その情報と同じような情報は CFF テーブル内部で提供されています)。"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6loca.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6loca.html"},"children":["loca"]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_loca.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_loca.html"},"children":["loca"]}]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["maxp"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>maximum profile</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["最大プロファイル"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>Provides general \"maximum\" information about the font. This contains:\n      the maximum number of glyphs in a font, the maximum number of points in a\n      glyph, the maximum number of references in a glyph, etc.</TD> "},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["フォントに関する一般的な“最大値”情報を提供します。こねには、フォント内のグリフの最大個数・グリフ内の点の最大個数・グリフ内の参照の最大個数などが含まれます。\n    "]},{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6maxp.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6maxp.html"},"children":["maxp"]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_maxp.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_maxp.html"},"children":["maxp"]}]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["mort"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>metamorphosis</TD> "},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["メタモルフォーゼ"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>FontForge will read this table but not generate it. This table has been\n      replaced by the 'morx' table which will be generated instead. It is vaguely\n      equivalent to the GSUB table.</TD> "},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["FontForge はこのテーブルを読み込みますが、けっして出力することはありません。このテーブルの代わりに‘morx’テーブルを用いることになったので、そちらの方をこの代わりに出力します。大雑把に言えば、これは GSUB テーブルと等価です。\n    "]},{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6mort.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6mort.html"},"children":["mort"]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n      *"]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["morx"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>extended metamorphosis</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["拡張メタモルフォーゼ"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>Provides ligature information, swash, etc. for apple's truetype fonts.\n      FontForge can read and write this table. See the\n      <A HREF=\"gposgsub.html#AAT\">chapter on morx</A> in FontForge for more\n      information. Vaguely equivalent to 'GSUB'.</TD> "},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["Apple 形式の TrueType フォントで合字、スワッシュ文字などに関する情報を提供します。FontForge はこのテーブルの読み書きができます。より詳しい情報は、FontForge の ",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"gposgsub.page.json#AAT","hrefOriginal":"gposgsub.html#AAT"},"children":["morx に関する章"]},"を参照してください。大雑把に言えば、‘GSUB’と等価です。\n    "]},{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6morx.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6morx.html"},"children":["morx"]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n      *"]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","attributes":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["name"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>name</TD>"},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["名前"]},"\n",{"comment":"<TD>Provides certain standard strings relevant to the font (font name, family\n      name, license, etc.) in various languages. In Apple fonts also provides the\n      names of various features of the 'morx'/'mort' table.</TD> "},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":["フォントに関連するいくつかの標準的な文字列 (フォント名、ファミリー名、ライセンスなど) を各種の言語で提供します。Apple 形式のフォントでは‘morx/mort’テーブルの各種の機能の名前も提供します。\n    "]},{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6name.page.json","hrefOriginal":"http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6name.html"},"children":["name"]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"td","attributes":{},"children":[{"tag":"p","attributes":{"align":"Center"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"a","attributes":{"href":"http://partners.adobe.com/public/developer/opentype/index_name.page.json","hrefO